  "src": "HN",
  "title": "Show HN: Weedout – Safari extension that hides YouTube AI-labeled videos",
  "url": "https://masteranza.github.io/weedout/",
  "discuss": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49528895",
  "score": 154,
  "comments": 68,
  "age_h": 13.4,
  "text": "I&#x27;m the developer. I built this because AI-generated conspiracy videos were getting out of control in my own YouTube feed. Weedout is a $1.99 Safari extension for macOS that removes videos YouTube labels “Made with AI” from feed, search, related videos, playlists and Shorts. It uses YouTube&#x27;s label rather than AI detection, runs locally, and does not catch unlabeled videos.<p>Source for developers who want to fork or build: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;masteranza&#x2F;weedout-for-youtube\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;masteranza&#x2F;weedout-for-youtu"
 },
